Sources for `server-action` skill (see plans/skill-audits/server-action.md for the full audit):

- Next.js 16 docs — `'use server'` and defineAction semantics — distilled, not copied.
- Vercel security guidance — trust-boundary obligations for Server Actions.
- Solaar's webhook safety implementation — real-world source for withWebhookSafety / defineAction / defineFormAction patterns.

Strategy: native. Distilled from the three sources above and adapted to the void-harness convention where services own domain logic and actions are pure trust-boundary wrappers.
